Z||000017||DaRkLoRD||12-03-1999||06:33 PM||||What about a hexagon pattern like on a Camaro? (I think.. please correct me if I have the wrong car)<P>A guy did that to his Ford Probe GT.. he traced the shape of a large hexagon-shaped bolt onto masking tape, and made a bunch of little hexagons. He then cut them out and stuck them on the interior of his tail light lenses. A bit of black spraypaint, peel the tape off and you're done. Looked pretty good.||||reg||1
